This project uses Goxel and SLX_Studio

Open SLX studio

    1 -> Load png from folder where all pngs are.
    2 -> Write corresponding anchor points.
    3 -> Apply anchor points.
    3.1 ->If building has animations you need to duplicate png so that there are no empty frames:
        A) Data tag -> Apply
        B) Save(Ctrl + S)
    4 -> Save (Ctrl + S)
    5 -> Export (Ctrl + E)
        A) Save with a standard name from rename.py dictionary
        B) Object type -> Building
        C) Use shadow alphas -> Checked

Add to project
    1 -> Use rename.py (python rename.py standard_name)